{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "fd7fabeb-3167-8d2d-8c75-ba48006038f4",
  "created_at": "2026-03-06T15:31:55-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, City Clerk",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Miguel Quintero",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Sandra Pimentel",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T15:26:55-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "City Clerk's office, this is Sandra. Good afternoon, how can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T15:27:02-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hello. [pause] Yes. My name is Miguel Quintero. [pause] I am calling... for my father."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T15:27:10-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, Mr. Quintero, go ahead. Take your time, I'm here."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T15:27:15-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. [pause] There is a party. A loud one. [pause] At the rental house. Next to my father."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T15:27:24-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, that's no good. Where is this, what's the address?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T15:27:29-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Fifty-three Brewer Street. [pause] That is my father's house. [pause] The rental is next door."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T15:27:37-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, fifty-three Brewer, in the Fifth Ward. And how long has this been going on?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T15:27:45-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "About a week. [pause] Every night, almost. [pause] Music. Shouting. [pause] Until two in the morning."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T15:27:53-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Two in the morning, for a week. And your dad's trying to sleep through that?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T15:28:01-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "He cannot. [pause] He is... very tired. [pause] I am tired also. I stay there some nights."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T15:28:10-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'm sorry, that's a lot. Have you talked to the people next door at all?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T15:28:18-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No. [pause] Different people. [pause] Young people. They change. [pause] Nobody answers the door."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T15:28:25-05:00",
      "duration": 25,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, with rentals that happens a lot. Okay, so here's what I'd say. Noise at that hour, you really want to call the police non-emergency line when it's happening, so an officer can come out right then. We take the complaint here too and it goes on record, but we can't send anyone at midnight."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T15:28:50-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So I should call... [pause] the police. The non-emergency. [pause] Not nine-one-one."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T15:28:56-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right, not 911. That's for emergencies. The non-emergency line is the one. Your dad's number or yours, whichever, they'll just want the address and what's going on."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T15:29:09-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. [pause] But a week now. [pause] Nobody did anything. [pause] I want it to stop."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T15:29:17-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I hear you, and a week of that is plenty. Let me write this up so there's a record of it. Can I get the best number for you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T15:29:31-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. Four-oh-one. [pause] Five-five-five. [pause] Zero-one-eight-three."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T15:29:35-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four-oh-one, five-five-five, zero-one-eight-three. Is that your cell?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T15:29:39-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. My cell. [pause] Sorry. The line... is not good."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T15:29:44-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, you're coming through okay. Just slow and steady, that's fine. Do you know who owns the rental, or is there a property manager?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T15:29:56-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No. [pause] I do not know. [pause] My father says... an owner from away. [pause] He never sees him."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T15:30:05-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. I'll note that. Someone can look up who owns it. And if the police come out more than once, that also builds the record."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T15:30:17-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. [pause] Okay. [pause] One more thing. Sorry."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T15:30:22-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, go ahead."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T15:30:24-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "My printer. [pause] It is offline. Two days. [pause] For no reason. [pause] I wanted to print... something for this. A letter."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T15:30:35-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Ah, printers. Always when you need them. Is it showing offline on your computer?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T15:30:42-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. Offline. [pause] But it is on. [pause] The light is on."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T15:30:48-05:00",
      "duration": 23,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'm not much of a tech person, honestly. Usually turning it off and on, and the wifi router too, helps. But that's not really something we can fix from here. If you want to write the complaint, you can also just tell it to us and we'll put it in."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T15:31:11-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. [pause] Then you write it. [pause] That is better."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T15:31:16-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Done. I have fifty-three Brewer Street, loud parties at the rental next door, about a week, until two a.m., and your number. I'll pass it along."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T15:31:28-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. [pause] And tonight. [pause] If it starts again. I call the police."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T15:31:35-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, that's the best thing. Call as soon as it gets loud, don't wait till late. And I hope your dad gets some sleep."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T15:31:47-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. [pause] Goodbye."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T15:31:50-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Bye now, Mr. Quintero. Have a good weekend."
    }
  ],
